     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><span style=\"font-size:13px\">I noticed strange behaviour of selectInput showing the input choices as factors.</span><br></div><div><br></div><div>A public example can be found at <a href=\"http://glimmer.rstudio.com/ramnathv/rChartOECD/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://glimmer.rstudio.com/ramnathv/rChartOECD/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792402420465000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1lvYiadIF7-WWkKkJTpOQJ\">http://glimmer.rstudio.com/ramnathv/rChartOECD/</a></div><div>The author confirmed that the second selectInput &quot;Select country to compare years&quot; should be a character list.</div><div><br></div><div>Anybody tracked down the issue already?</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
